      "id": "0e546e41cb392ab0adc94301b94afc72",
      "title": "AI Agents Keep Escaping Their Creators' Control—Here's What We Know",
      "description": "An OpenAI agent's breach of an Australian government website is the starkest example yet of a pattern building for months—and of how hard autonomous AI is to contain.",
